{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If an object is nearby, move, take, process it and put it back. Scan for visible objects, move to one or scan the area. list of available nodes: <Action ID = IsObjectNearby    /> <Action ID = ScanForObjects    /> <Action ID = MoveToVisibleObject    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObjects    /> <Action ID = MoveToObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = ProcessObjectTasks    /> <Action ID = PutObjectBack    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectTakeable    /> <Condition ID = IsAnyObjectVisible    />",
